WEBVTT

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:31.480
Cheers.

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:36.060
The girl with the most vitality and the most passion

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:43.680
After arriving in the city

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:46.660
Because of the club and the girl with the most vitality

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:47.260
She became very busy

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:48.780
With the mermaid Lola

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:02.100
What are we going to do for this event?

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.950
Sorry, I have to go home.

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:07.200
The final exam is almost here.

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:08.360
You have to study hard.

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:11.450
Zhen Xia, is it okay if you don't prepare for the exam?

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:13.290
It's okay.

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:15.020
That's weird.

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:18.740
This is the exam paper I got today.

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:20.360
Is the full score 10 points?

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:22.660
No, it's 100 points.

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:25.220
My performance is a bit bad.

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:27.670
It should not only be a bit bad.

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:29.730
If you don't pass the final exam, you will be banned.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.280
to participate in the club activities.

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:32.260
What?

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:36.010
You have to quit the Fiery Passion Club.

00:02:36.190 --> 00:02:37.590
But I...

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.370
I have to work hard to recover.

00:02:39.870 --> 00:02:48.010
Mr. Chong Jili,

00:02:48.510 --> 00:02:50.420
you've been cooking seafood

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:52.260
for a long time.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:53.930
Although it's troublesome,

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:54.710
I can't help it

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:55.990
if you want to eat it.

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:58.130
Thank you.

00:02:58.850 --> 00:02:59.810
Since you've done it,

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.700
Why don't you use your vital energy instead?

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.340
I refuse. I have to continue stewing this dish.

00:03:04.720 --> 00:03:06.720
Don't worry. Just use this.

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:10.770
This is given by the Demon Lady.

00:03:11.350 --> 00:03:13.920
You can feel her powerful power.

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:16.360
You are indeed a good cook, Mr. Qiong Jili.

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:21.270
Even if you continue stewing and collecting vital energy,

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:22.230
it's not impossible.

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:36.270
The most important thing now is to review in advance

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:39.420
Lola, Puyo Puyo, don't interfere with me

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:41.620
I won't

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:45.200
I'm going to start working

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:56.190
Coca-Cola

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:10.210
Okay, let's sort it out!

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:20.990
Who's going to start studying?

00:04:21.670 --> 00:04:24.010
You don't want to study at all, do you?

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:43.530
I've never really prepared for it.

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:46.560
That means I don't have to spend time to prepare, right?

00:04:46.700 --> 00:04:50.120
Zhen Xia, Xiao Shi's grades have always been very good.

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.330
You can't take her as a standard.

00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:54.870
I'll keep the knowledge I learned in my head that day.

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:59.190
This way, I don't have to spend time to study and prepare before the exam.

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:03.040
No, this is too difficult, isn't it?

00:05:03.040 --> 00:05:04.680
No wonder she's the top student of the year.

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:07.940
Learning is about working hard, isn't it?

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:09.410
I'm so envious of mermaids.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:10.710
They don't even need exams.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:12.870
Mermaids also have exams, okay?

00:05:13.390 --> 00:05:14.520
If you want to become the queen,

00:05:14.700 --> 00:05:16.480
you have to learn all kinds of knowledge.

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:17.300
Are you listening?

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:19.410
I only understood one thing.

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:22.400
Preparing for exams is not enthusiastic at all.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:26.580
Where are you from?

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:28.030
I'm from Japan.

00:05:28.330 --> 00:05:29.390
Oh, me too.

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:29.850
Two, one.

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:32.350
It's really hard work.

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:34.170
I accept your energy.

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:37.050
Come out.

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:39.010
Super Tuotuo Monster.

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:49.240
First, confirm the exam range.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:51.040
From here.

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:56.480
So much?

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:59.260
Exam range.

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:00.820
I'm so worried

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:03.320
But no matter what

00:06:03.320 --> 00:06:04.470
I must

00:06:04.470 --> 00:06:05.990
For the sake of my friends

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:19.300
Meile

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:21.690
I will never fail again this time

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:22.760
Let me introduce

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.890
Super Toto Monster

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:27.960
I'm not a classmate

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:29.900
Don't

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:30.670
Are you afraid when you see the textbook?

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:33.280
No, I'm not afraid.

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:02.080
Hair

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:02.540
Who?

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:37.670
Shining wings

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:43.690
The wings that follow the wind

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:45.720
Red angel

00:07:46.090 --> 00:07:56.070
I still have exams

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:58.250
We fight fast

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:05.010
What's going on?

00:08:05.030 --> 00:08:07.560
It seems that it's not the same as before.

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:08.440
I'm a ghost!

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:09.740
Ghost!

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:32.140
This Toto is different from the one I met before.

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:33.290
So strong.

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:34.840
What kind of monster is this?

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:51.880
I don't want to do anything

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:54.310
I'm done

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:59.410
Lando's Glamorous Beauty is so funny

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.020
This is too...

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:48.880
How dare you!

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:14.400
I don't know what's going on, but I'm saved.

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:23.130
I can do it. Don't worry about me.

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:27.150
I don't feel energetic at all.

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:31.920
Do you think you're still a beautiful girl?

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:35.060
A beautiful girl is so troublesome.

00:11:35.720 --> 00:11:36.920
I don't want to be one.

00:11:38.020 --> 00:11:53.220
Dad, where are you going?

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:55.740
To get back my crystal.

00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:58.740
Why don't you want to be a beautiful girl?

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:05.690
What did you say?

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:09.300
I said that Demoness has gone to rest.

00:12:09.780 --> 00:12:10.840
Please wait a moment.

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:14.520
I heard that Demoness said that she wanted to eat this dish.

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:15.640
That's why she made it.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:17.870
I had to wait for her to eat it.

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:19.910
Because it's the Demoness who sells it.

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:22.760
By the way, have you collected all the energy?

00:12:24.140 --> 00:12:25.420
I'll be right there.

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:29.270
This dish won't taste good if it gets cold.

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:33.160
This is the new one. Do you want to try it?

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:35.420
Oh, forget it.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:37.450
This is very interesting.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:40.140
Do you want to see it?

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:41.440
But I want to sleep.

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:45.120
Let's eat mango pineapple bread together.

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.340
It's so troublesome to move my mouth.

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:50.800
I'll give you all my energy.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:52.320
Calm down.

00:12:52.800 --> 00:12:57.300
I'm sorry. Of course I understand. But...

00:12:57.300 --> 00:12:58.750
Can I sleep?

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:01.460
It's okay.

00:13:01.620 --> 00:13:03.590
Lola will find her vitality back.

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:04.690
Shut up!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:15.100
Take all the vitality and energy of the human.

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:17.520
Stop!

00:13:18.980 --> 00:13:28.960
Did you get washed into the sea?

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:52.910
If I can't find it, I'll have to hurry up and stand in front of this stream.

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:58.140
No, no, no.

00:14:00.092 --> 00:14:02.212
How can I get in when the water is so dirty?

00:14:26.876 --> 00:14:29.716
It's none of your business

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:33.860
Everything is important, it's up to us to make the decision!

00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:42.090
We will not allow you to just walk around, but we will...

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:46.720
...save everyone's lives, this is...

00:14:46.720 --> 00:14:51.920
...important...

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:39.980
What's wrong? It's not working anymore.

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:40.840
What did you say?

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:55.250
It's not working.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:58.290
It's blocking the road!

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:08.580
It's over!

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:26.240
It's finally over!

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:27.880
Not yet.

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:28.500
What?

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:33.030
What are you doing? Why are you still here?

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:36.990
I won't let you bully me.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:39.860
I won't let you bully me.

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:48.070
What's going on?

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:17.130
The energy will keep coming out

00:17:30.160 --> 00:17:30.940
Let's go, too.

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:32.120
We can't lie down on our own.

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:33.920
Take out our power.

00:17:35.230 --> 00:17:38.380
No matter how many people there are, we can't win.

00:17:39.020 --> 00:17:40.220
The beautiful girl of the palace

00:17:40.220 --> 00:17:43.600
won't be able to live without Zhenxia.

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:10.420
Do you want to try the nail polish?

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:12.940
Oh, the new nail polish.

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:15.660
I think this is very suitable for Zhen Xia.

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:20.220
Do you want to see this book created by a super star?

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:27.050
Do you want to eat the pineapple bread with mango flavor?

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:35.040
Then, let's get rid of them as soon as possible!

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:36.560
Let's do it together!

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:58.480
I'm going to stay more.

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:03.090
How could it be like this?

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:04.850
I can't do it at all!

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:16.450
What's wrong? What's wrong?

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:17.730
Are you angry?

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:46.870
It's a little smelly

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:47.450
No

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:59.400
Even if it's not enough, it's still pretty good

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:01.740
Ordinary people can't do it.

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:03.200
I've been working hard.

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:05.060
It's not bad to be banned from the club activities.

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:08.440
Focus on being a beautiful girl.

00:21:08.540 --> 00:21:08.980
No.

00:21:09.540 --> 00:21:11.400
Whether it's a hot-blooded girl or a beautiful girl,

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:14.640
there's still a chance.

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:17.130
If you pass the exam in a week,

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:19.010
you won't be banned from the club activities.

00:21:20.420 --> 00:21:24.210
I'll work hard this time.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:28.690
The exam is to be with everyone in a hot-blooded girl.

00:21:30.160 --> 00:21:30.540
Is that true?

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:31.980
If there's anything you don't understand

00:21:32.400 --> 00:21:34.000
I'll teach you until the end

00:21:34.000 --> 00:21:35.480
Let's do it together

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:46.200
Let's have an event together

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:46.240
What?

00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:47.840
Seriously

00:21:47.840 --> 00:21:50.840
There are different shapes of sand

00:21:50.840 --> 00:21:52.360
Let's work hard to win the championship

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:52.760
OK

00:21:52.760 --> 00:21:57.360
Let's have fun

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:00.370
Thank you.
